    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:49b18e3fb3f9ec7b",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "8c5d34bb79188356935a4ba9810cad9e4f47937c5857bc09ec666ce2ee21e70c",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261110-tsvc722k5p",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "Spend the day exploring historic Cartagena. You'll return to the UNESCO World Heritage-listed old town for a closer look at the neighbourhoods within the city walls.\n\nThe route takes you past bastions, churches, convents and colonial houses. Cartagena was a strategic Caribbean port for many years, and its defences still shape the cityscape. San Felipe Fortress, the city walls and the towers recall a time when Cartagena guarded the riches shipped across the Atlantic.\n\nAfter the tour, return to your hotel and rest."
